  }, {
    "heading": "3-node-qsfp-ring-mode-b-and-mode-c",
    "content": "`highspeed_interfaces: enp1s0f0np0,enp1s0f1np1` is the pair reference. Ring Jobs in `k8s/workloads/glm-5.3-flash/` and `deepseek-v4.1-flash/` already have the ring block."
