  }, {
    "heading": "4--5-nodes--mikrotik-crs804-4ddq-hrm-switch",
    "content": "**5 nodes:** three full ports + one port split with a breakout cable into\n`sfpplus4a` / `sfpplus4b` (two 200G lanes). Both lanes must be declared in the\n`switch.port_map` — the topology validator rejects a lone lane."
  }, {
    "heading": "4--5-nodes--mikrotik-crs804-4ddq-hrm-switch",
