    "heading": "visual-regression-tests-for-the-rendered-docs-site-goldens--approval",
    "content": "`//docs-site:visual_tooling_test` — guards that the container image stays pinned to the\nPlaywright release the suite imports, that it matches the CI platform, and that the spec never\ninvents a baseline under CI"
