    "heading": "1-core-principles",
    "content": "**Stability first**"
  }, {
    "heading": "1-core-principles",
    "content": "SSH, K3s, and the dashboard must stay responsive under heavy GPU load."
  }, {
    "heading": "1-core-principles",
    "content": "**Explicit resources**"
  }, {
    "heading": "1-core-principles",
    "content": "Every heavy workload has `resources.requests` and `resources.limits`."
  }, {
    "heading": "1-core-principles",
    "content": "**No auto-start**"
  }, {
    "heading": "1-core-principles",
    "content": "Heavy inference Jobs never start on reboot. Operators start them deliberately."
  }, {
    "heading": "1-core-principles",
    "content": "**Low backoff**"
  }, {
    "heading": "1-core-principles",
    "content": "Production inference Jobs use `restartPolicy: OnFailure` (or `Never`) with a low `backoffLimit`."
  }, {
    "heading": "1-core-principles",
    "content": "**High-speed NCCL**"
  }, {
    "heading": "1-core-principles",
    "content": "Multi-node workloads set `NCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME` and related vars for dual 400G links."
  }, {
    "heading": "1-core-principles",
    "content": "**Test before production**"
  }, {
    "heading": "1-core-principles",
    "content": "Lighter `*-test` variants validate clusters before heavy `kimi`-class jobs."
  }, {
    "heading": "1-core-principles",
    "content": "**Defense in depth**"
  }, {
    "heading": "1-core-principles",
    "content": "Policy files, runtime checks, Kubernetes guardrails, and static greps all enforce safety."
  }, {
    "heading": "1-core-principles",
    "content": "**Hermetic tests**"
